abstract: |
  The Aalto Dictionary of Machine Learning (ADictML) provides concise, 
  cross-referenced definitions and visual explanations of key concepts in 
  machine learning and artificial intelligence. Developed at Aalto University 
  by the Aalto Machine Learning Group, ADictML serves as both a pedagogical 
  resource and an open, citable scientific reference.
